stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Free
    Free --> Reserved: reservation_table row created for a future slot
    Reserved --> Occupied: start_time reached, guests seated
    Occupied --> Cleaning: end_time reached / guests leave
    Cleaning --> Free: cleared for the next booking
    Free --> OutOfService: manager sets is_active=false
    OutOfService --> Free: manager sets is_active=true
    note right of Reserved
        several reservation_table rows can queue
        on the same table for different time slots
    end note
    note right of OutOfService
        table removed from booking rotation,
        logged separately in maintenances by item name
    end note
